---
/**
 * Step 8 of the homepage hierarchy: the "how", arriving after the experience
 * rather than before it. This is the page's second dark band — it anchors the
 * lower half the way the difference section anchors the upper half.
 *
 * Deliberately carries no CTA. The pricing section immediately below it does.
 */
---

<section class="how-it-works section" aria-label="How membership works">
  <div class="container how-inner">
    <span class="section-label how-label">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="how-title">Membership, simply</h2>
    <p>
      You pay a flat monthly fee directly to the practice. We don't bill insurance,
      which is what makes the small panel and the long visit financially possible in
      the first place.
    </p>
    <p>
      Membership covers your primary care. Most members pair it with a high-deductible
      plan for hospitalization, surgery, and specialist care. Nothing about your visit
      is shaped by what a billing code will reimburse.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    background: var(--green-500);
  }
  .how-inner {
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  /* The shared .section-label green disappears against the green band. */
  .how-label {
    color: var(--green-200);
  }
  .how-title {
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .how-it-works p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .how-it-works p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .how-it-works p { font-size: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
